        "created_at": "2013-05-26T22:31:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Haha, that's cool :D. The Matriarch frequently kicks our arses - this weekend we had a game in which both cohorts came out on the first turn. As a result, we never really got going (Huginn kept breaking too much stuff) and she destroyed us within about fifteen minutes or something :P.</p><p>A fun game we had against her was in the Final Wasteland though, a while back - first environment card was a Horrid Skunk Ape. Second was the Unforgiving Wasteland. The Matriarch's deck at the end of the game consisted of all her non-target cards and a single Carrion Field :D.</p>",
